    not_duplicate_of: []  # 2eee
    pr_ref:  # 2eee
    description: "Pass 13: 8 of 84 analysis_runs entries have files_analyzed=0 with nonzero duration_ms: pyffi-linker (4570ms), di-resolution (2550ms), method-call-recovery (364ms), annotation-convention-linker (247ms), containment-linker (126ms), inherited-calls-linker (71ms), inheritance-linker (49ms), requirements (42ms). Total: ~8s of work invisible to file-count throughput metrics. Confused dogfooding investigations in passes 12 and 13. Either rename files_analyzed (and add ir_units_processed) or document that 0 means 'graph-only synthesis pass'."  # 2eee
    fields:  # 2eee
      statement: "Every analysis_runs entry that contributes nonzero work to bm.json has files_analyzed > 0."  # 2eee
      root_cause: "Synthesis passes (pyffi-linker, di-resolution, method-call-recovery, annotation-convention-linker, containment-linker, inherited-calls-linker, inheritance-linker, requirements) traverse the IR rather than files, so they have no natural files_analyzed counter; the AnalysisRun.files_analyzed field is initialized to 0 and never updated for these passes."  # 2eee
